in of events leading to Rakshasa having no choice but to support Chandragupta", "role": "answer_reveal", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-11T16:41:03Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "Here is a commemorative cover India Post issued in 2024 about Chandragupta, Chanakya, and his own book the Arthashastra", "role": "answer_reveal", "is_correct": null, "has_media": true, "media": null}]